== Effects ==
* Upon use, spawns a pile of {{e|Poop}} where Isaac is standing and [[Knock-back|knocks back]] nearby enemies. This pile of poop may yield [[pickups]] like regular poop.
** {{dlc|a}} Also knocks back pickups and enemy shots upon use.
* {{transformation contribution|Oh Crap}}

== Notes ==
* {{C|???}} starts with this item by default.
* In combination with {{t|Petrified Poop}}, this item becomes far more useful. With moderate luck, a poop pile spawned by this item may drop the trinket itself, and with a method of generating unlimited battery charge, it becomes a matter of time. With the trinket, The Poop can easily become a better source of Hearts and money than other items that require more charges, such as {{i|Book of Revelations}} or {{I|The Book of Sin}}.
* {{dlc+|a+}} This item can spawn as a possible payout of {{I|Mystery Gift}}. Mystery Gift can drop this item even if Isaac has already encountered/possessed it.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc+|r}} This item can rarely drop from destroying [[Rocks#Buckets|buckets]] in {{s|Dross}}.
** It can also be spawned by {{e|Bumbino}} if he picks up 12 cents.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc+|r+}} This item has a 1% chance to drop when defeating {{e|Dingle}}.{{dlc-}}
* Poops can bridge gaps when bombed from the opposite side (the same way [[Rocks|standard rocks]] can).
* If used on top of an obstacle while flying, it will only produce its sound effect, but no poop will be spawned.
** {{dlc|nr}} This also applies to destroyed obstacles.
* If Isaac has {{i|Thunder Thighs}}, {{i|Leo}}, or {{tf|Stompy}}, the poop will be destroyed beneath you as soon as it is placed.
* {{dlc+|a+}} After defeating {{E|Ultra Greedier}}, all remaining piles of poop in the room will be converted into {{e|Golden Poop}}s.
** {{dlc|r}} This effect is purely visual; the "golden" poop acts as regular poop despite the recolor.{{dlc-}}
* The Poop can be used to permanently destroy {{e|Red Poop}}s while they're temporarily disabled. {{dlc|r}} The same is true of [[Spikes#Retractable Spikes|retractable spikes]] while they're retracted.

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Bird's Eye}} / {{I|Ghost Pepper}}: Fire will appear behind Isaac when The Poop is used.
* {{Book of Virtues synergy|description=Spawns wisps on the outer ring, looking like miniature {{E|Dip}}s. Wisps' tears have a 2.5% chance to apply {{I|E. Coli}} to enemies, turning them to poop.}}
* {{T|Brown Cap}}: The Poop may be used as a discounted {{I|Mine Crafter}}, both for utility, as well as combat.
* {{t|Gigante Bean}}: Deals 10 flat damage to nearby enemies.
* {{i|Hallowed Ground}}: Using The Poop will always spawn a {{E|White Poop|n}}.
* {{t|Meconium}}: Using The Poop has chance to spawn a {{E|Black Poop|n}}.
* {{i|Midas' Touch}}: Using The Poop has a chance to spawn {{E|Golden Poop}}.
** The chance of this effect is 100% at {{dlc|nr}} 5 [[Luck]] / {{dlc|r}} 6.56 [[Luck]]
* {{i|9 Volt}}: Can be used in an incomplete room to repeatedly spawn poop.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Car Battery}}: No effect.
* {{I|Dirty Mind}}: Allows the creation of extra [[Familiar#Dips|Dip familiars]].

